            >
                Full-Stack Web Developer
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base">
                Independent and personal projects &nbsp;•&nbsp; Self-employed
            </p>
            <p
                class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5"
                id="thirdRecord"
                x-init="document.getElementById('thirdRecord').innerHTML = formatDateRange('2014-05-01', '2019-07-31')"
            >
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                East Azerbaijan Province, Iran &nbsp;•&nbsp; Remote
            </p>

            <div
                class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mt-3 space-y-3 max-w-3xl"
            >
                <p>
                    Designed, developed, and deployed web-based applications
                    using Laravel, while optimizing MariaDB databases for
                    performance and reliability. Developed RESTful APIs and
                    integrated software services with third-party systems.
                    Managed the full software development lifecycle (SDLC), from
                    requirements analysis and system design to deployment and
                    ongoing maintenance.
                </p>

                <p x-show="expanded" x-cloak x-transition>
                    Collaborated directly with clients to gather requirements,
                    manage project changes, and ensure successful project
                    delivery. Prepared technical documentation and delivered
                    user training when required.
                </p>

                <p
                    x-show="!expanded"
                    class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500"
                >
                    Collaborated directly with...
                </p>
            </div>
            <br />
            <button
                @click="expanded = !expanded"
                class="border border-slate-800 px-[1rem] py-[.5rem] focus-ring flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white rounded-full"
            >
                <span x-text="expanded ? 'Show less' : 'Show More'"></span>
                <svg
                    class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform"
                    :class="expanded && 'rotate-180'"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="2"
                >
                    <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
